@startuml
title GET /api/v1/course-content/{id} - Get Course Content By Id Flow

start

:Client sends GET /api/v1/course-content/{id} request;

note right
Optional Query Parameters (or Body Parameters):
- None
end note

:JWT Authentication Middleware validates access token;

if (JWT token valid?) then (Yes)

    :Request reaches CourseContentController;

    :Controller validates parameters;

    if (Validation failed?) then (Yes)
        :Return 400 Bad Request;
        stop
    endif

    :Controller forwards request to Mediator;

    :Mediator sends request to Repository/Handler layer;

    :Handler calls CourseContentRepository to retrieve content;

    if (Content exists?) then (Yes)
        :Map entity to DTO;
        :Return 200 OK;
    else (No)
        :Return 404 Not Found;
    endif

else (No)

    :Return 401 Unauthorized;

endif

stop

@enduml
